        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Hallas takes the broken shard and turns it in the firelight.* Fifteen levels -- a captain's years, and a captain's scars, I'll wager. You have borne this faithfully. There is a smith I trust, two streets over; the steel is sound beneath the ruin. Let it be reforged, and let it answer your hand as it once answered his. Shall it be done?"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 5,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
