        },
        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The Shieldwarden raises his cup to you.* The Unbroken Shield, and the blade made whole -- you have walked the first road of it, and walked it well. There are harder oaths and heavier charges yet, when the wars of the South and the East come calling. But that is a tale for another day. Stand fast, soldier."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 6,
        "Animation": {
