          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The grey soldier gives you a courteous nod.* Well met, traveller. I keep to my ale and my old campaigns -- soldier's talk, of little use to those who have not carried a shield in the wall. Fare you well."
          }
        }
      },
      {
