          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He wraps the broken hilt and sets it in your pack himself.* Carry it well. Steel remembers the hand that bore it faithfully -- come back at fifteen, and we will see it made whole."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 9,
