        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*A day later the smith's work is done: the notches are gone, the edge is true.* There -- the Warden's Reforged Blade. No relic of the Elder Days, mind; only honest steel, well made and well earned. It will not fail a fighter's hand. You have walked the first road of the Unbroken Shield -- stand fast, soldier."
          }
        }
      }
